/* 어빌리티 타임라인 툴 디자인 폴리시 (W-A 상세 패널 + 마커). 코드가 동적 위치를 잡고, 여기선 외형만. */

.atl-details {
    padding: 8px 10px;
}

.atl-section {
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-top: 8px;
    border-top-width: 1px;
    border-top-color: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.22);
}

.atl-section-title {
    -unity-font-style: bold;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: rgba(150, 150, 150, 0.92);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.atl-hint {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: rgba(150, 150, 150, 0.75);
    white-space: normal;
    margin: 2px 0 4px 0;
}

.atl-field {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.atl-field .unity-base-field__label {
    min-width: 74px;
    max-width: 74px;
}

.atl-btn-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    margin-top: 6px;
}

.atl-btn-row > Button {
    margin-left: 2px;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.atl-method-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.atl-marker {
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 10px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-left;
    overflow: hidden;
}
